to save yourself.

704
00:46:02.744 --> 00:46:04.678
to change your fate."

705
00:46:05.093 --> 00:46:07.496
Now. the prince agrees.
opens up the scroll.

706
00:46:07.498 --> 00:46:09.488
News ain't good.
not even a little bit.

707
00:46:09.490 --> 00:46:10.858
So you know what he does?
Come here.

708
00:46:12.506 --> 00:46:15.267
